0.9964878 3.1714523 0.9798956 0.9993906 
```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
# 3) cor.test() usa el mismo método
cor.test(x, y)$conf.int
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 0.9798956 0.9993906
attr(,"conf.level")
[1] 0.95
```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
# 4) Prueba de H0: rho <= 0.90 contra H1: rho > 0.90
Z <- (z_r - atanh(0.90)) * sqrt(n - 3)
c(Z = Z, p = pnorm(Z, lower.tail = FALSE))
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
